{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0107-s001", "text": "Skilsmässa betyder att ett äktenskap upplöses.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0107-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.336181640625, "generation_seconds": 15.391092580044642, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0107-s002", "text": "Makarna kan ansöka om skilsmässa tillsammans, eller så kan den ena maken ansöka på egen hand.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0107-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.28515625, "generation_seconds": 29.509261417901143, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0107-s003", "text": "För en skilsmässa behövs inte bådas samtycke och inga särskilda förklaringar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0107-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.283782958984375, "generation_seconds": 23.1384425109718, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0107-s004", "text": "Man ansöker om skilsmässa skriftligt hos en tingsrätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0107-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.3150634765625, "generation_seconds": 16.69698276394047, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0107-s005", "text": "Rätten utreder inte varför makarna ansöker om skilsmässa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0107-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.3768310546875, "generation_seconds": 19.232542783021927, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0108-s001", "text": "Ansökan om skilsmässa görs i två steg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0108-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.9706122448979593, "peak": 0.30126953125, "generation_seconds": 12.88361764489673, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0108-s002", "text": "Först lämnar man in skilsmässoansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0108-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.33197021484375, "generation_seconds": 13.607929247897118, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0108-s003", "text": "Efter betänketiden fullföljer man sin ansökan med en ny ansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T050828236035Z/hb-c09-u0108-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.283660888671875, "generation_seconds": 17.79852008400485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0108-s004", "text": "Domstolen dömer till skilsmässa först efter att den andra ansökan har lämnats in.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0108-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.399566650390625, "generation_seconds": 23.212769186822698, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0108-s005", "text": "Parterna döms till skilsmässa även om den andra parten motsätter sig det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0108-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.268890380859375, "generation_seconds": 21.73381570004858, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0109-s001", "text": "När den första ansökan om skilsmässa har lämnats in börjar en sex månader lång betänketid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0109-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.251617431640625, "generation_seconds": 28.408037520945072, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0109-s002", "text": "Betänketiden är obligatorisk, förutom om du och din maka/make har bott på skilda adresser de senaste två åren.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0109-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.375244140625, "generation_seconds": 36.093190517043695, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0110-s001", "text": "Om du och din maka/make ansöker om skilsmässa tillsammans, börjar betänketiden direkt när er gemensamma ansökan har kommit in hos tingsrätten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0110-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.19047619047619, "peak": 0.267333984375, "generation_seconds": 43.25273947883397, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0111-s001", "text": "Om en av makarna ensam ansöker om skilsmässa, börjar betänketiden från den dag då ansökan delges den andra makan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0111-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.3426513671875, "generation_seconds": 35.35961286700331, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0111-s002", "text": "Tingsrätten ser till att ansökan delges den andra makan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0111-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.314666748046875, "generation_seconds": 25.257665351964533, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0112-s001", "text": "Det är viktigt att lämna in den andra ansökan om skilsmässa inom ett år efter att betänketiden började.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051127836794Z/hb-c09-u0112-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.364837646484375, "generation_seconds": 41.571143426932395, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0112-s002", "text": "I annat fall förfaller ärendet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0112-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.31585693359375, "generation_seconds": 14.611055130837485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0113-s001", "text": "I samband med en skilsmässa görs en avvittring av egendom, det vill säga parets egendom delas enligt antingen äktenskapslagen eller ett äktenskapsförord.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0113-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.49005126953125, "generation_seconds": 59.51041932683438, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0113-s002", "text": "Ibland uppstår det bråk om egendom eller barnen vid en skilsmässa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0113-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.060408163265306, "peak": 0.36328125, "generation_seconds": 25.681431432953104, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0113-s003", "text": "Då kan paret behöva juridisk hjälp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0113-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.294036865234375, "generation_seconds": 15.314013051101938, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0114-s001", "text": "Nuförtiden är skilsmässor vanliga i Finland, och människor är inte tvungna att stanna i ett olyckligt äktenskap.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0114-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.28704833984375, "generation_seconds": 41.75400568684563, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0114-s002", "text": "En skilsmässa är ingen skam i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0114-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.251983642578125, "generation_seconds": 14.577043080003932, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0114-s003", "text": "Det är också vanligt att människor gifter sig på nytt med en ny partner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0114-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.28790283203125, "generation_seconds": 27.443261306965724, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0115-s001", "text": "Bodelningen vid skilsmässa kan vara en komplicerad process.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T051624252598Z/hb-c09-u0115-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.256439208984375, "generation_seconds": 20.36678891000338, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0115-s002", "text": "Ni kan tillsammans komma överens om hur ni delar era tillgångar och skulder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0115-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.284698486328125, "generation_seconds": 27.23072383995168, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0115-s003", "text": "Ni kan också be om hjälp av en jurist.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0115-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.040272108843538, "peak": 0.2259521484375, "generation_seconds": 17.987404061947018, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0116-s001", "text": "Om ni har bolån är det viktigt att komma överens om hur ni delar lånet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0116-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.218505859375, "generation_seconds": 26.901816515950486, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0116-s002", "text": "Ni kan också tillsammans bestämma vem av er som får bo kvar i det gemensamma hemmet tills vidare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0116-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.259063720703125, "generation_seconds": 32.26655325689353, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0117-s001", "text": "Om ni inte kan komma överens om hur ni ska dela upp egendomen, kan vem som helst av makarna kräva egendomsfördelning, det vill säga bodelning (ositus).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0117-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.956734693877552, "peak": 0.29669189453125, "generation_seconds": 53.18301366106607, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0117-s002", "text": "Bodelningen kan göras direkt när man har lämnat in den första skilsmässoansökan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0117-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.2935791015625, "generation_seconds": 27.025896845851094, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0117-s003", "text": "Man behöver alltså inte vänta tills betänketiden på sex månader har gått ut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0117-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.325958251953125, "generation_seconds": 22.40337604493834, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0118-s001", "text": "När ni kräver bodelning förordnar tingsrätten en bodelningsman som delar egendomen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052040416442Z/hb-c09-u0118-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.247528076171875, "generation_seconds": 24.492660474032164, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0118-s002", "text": "Bodelningsmannen tar betalt för arbetet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0118-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.321533203125, "generation_seconds": 13.374370898120105, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0119-s001", "text": "När bodelningen inleds ska man utreda hur mycket egendom och skulder vardera maka har.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0119-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.2642822265625, "generation_seconds": 23.233914559939876, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0120-s001", "text": "Om du eller din maka/make kommer från något annat land än Finland kan vissa rättsliga frågor påverkas av lagarna i ett annat land.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0120-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.42421768707483, "peak": 0.423980712890625, "generation_seconds": 38.211889440892264, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0121-s001", "text": "Du kan be om råd av en jurist som har erfarenhet av denna typ av ärenden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0121-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.2430419921875, "generation_seconds": 23.002427065046504, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0122-s001", "text": "Om ditt äktenskap slutar med skilsmässa, ändras inte ditt efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0122-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.408707482993197, "peak": 0.346282958984375, "generation_seconds": 21.88020225102082, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0122-s002", "text": "Om du vill kan du ta ett annat efternamn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0122-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.8312925170068026, "peak": 0.27142333984375, "generation_seconds": 13.097014743834734, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0122-s003", "text": "Du kan till exempel ta vilket som helst namn som du har haft tidigare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0122-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.342315673828125, "generation_seconds": 21.605497305979952, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0123-s001", "text": "När ni överväger skilsmässa och behöver hjälp med att komma överens om saker och ting, kan ni ansöka om medling i familjefrågor (perheasioiden sovittelu).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052513327218Z/hb-c09-u0123-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.305034013605443, "peak": 0.29632568359375, "generation_seconds": 42.947325490182266, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0123-s002", "text": "Medling kan ofta vara nyttig och hjälpa er att komma överens i olika frågor utan rättegång.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0123-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.308990478515625, "generation_seconds": 30.986537531018257, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0123-s003", "text": "Man kan till exempel prata om barnens situation i medlingen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0123-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.302459716796875, "generation_seconds": 19.957372568082064, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0124-s001", "text": "Vid problem i parförhållandet kan du söka hjälp till exempel hos fostrings- och familjerådgivningen (kasvatus- ja perheneuvonta) eller social- och hälsocentralen (sosiaali- ja terveyskeskus).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0124-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.23074829931973, "peak": 0.35565185546875, "generation_seconds": 52.20985142188147, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0125-s001", "text": "Vid en skilsmässa kan det uppstå frågor kring uppehållstillståndet, egendomen, underhållsbidraget eller barnets boende, vårdnad och umgänge.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0125-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.2747802734375, "generation_seconds": 25.057949715061113, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0125-s002", "text": "I juridiska ärenden får du hjälp av en jurist.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0125-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.272003173828125, "generation_seconds": 14.157285588094965, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0125-s003", "text": "Hen ger dig råd och ser till att dina rättigheter tillvaratas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0125-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.24725341796875, "generation_seconds": 15.661716268165037, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0125-s004", "text": "Du kan vända dig till en jurist även om det uppstår tvister i samband med skilsmässan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0125-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.2559814453125, "generation_seconds": 18.71286529302597, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0126-s001", "text": "Juridisk rådgivning erbjuds av advokatbyråer, juridiska byråer och statens rättshjälpsbyråer, där offentliga rättsbiträden arbetar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T052906261960Z/hb-c09-u0126-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.31011962890625, "generation_seconds": 29.207819437840953, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0127-s001", "text": "Juristtjänsterna är avgiftsbelagda men om du har låg eller medelhög inkomst, kan du få gratis eller delvis ersättningsgill juridisk hjälp vid statens rättshjälpsbyrå.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T053307658318Z/hb-c09-u0127-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.931972789115646, "peak": 0.31463623046875, "generation_seconds": 34.31017217715271, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0127-s002", "text": "Den offentliga rättshjälpen finns även tillgänglig på engelska och vid behov kan man använda tolktjänster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T053307658318Z/hb-c09-u0127-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.346649169921875, "generation_seconds": 30.06113091111183, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0127-s003", "text": "Offentlig rättshjälp söks vid statens rättshjälpsbyråer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T053307658318Z/hb-c09-u0127-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.285797119140625, "generation_seconds": 19.6193299558945, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0128-s001", "text": "Om du har en rättsskyddsförsäkring som ersätter dina utgifter, kan du inte få offentlig rättshjälp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T053307658318Z/hb-c09-u0128-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.26568603515625, "generation_seconds": 28.238472810946405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0128-s002", "text": "Ofta ingår rättsskyddsförsäkringen i hemförsäkringen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-skilsmassa/narration-resume-20261103T053307658318Z/hb-c09-u0128-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.25653076171875, "generation_seconds": 18.87344599305652, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
